Bind Npc 24406 Zone 1
Quest 461 "[Repeatable Solo] Haunga Warrior Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Imperial Guard] Bekar has commissioned you to hunt Haunga Warrior. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 10 of 1362, 1312 at direction_58

Requires player level >= 52 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 1250000 experience or 1900000 with premium

direction_58 = location "Haunga Warrior" about "Haunga Warrior\n Haunga endowed with relative intelligence, wears armor with Talia Skin affixed onto them " found "Karus Delaga Plains" at 1200 1750 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, [Imperial Palace Guard] Verca is recruiting warriors for a massive Haunga hunt. Why don't you go join him?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "This time it's hunting the Haunga Warriors, so do you want to be on it? By the way, a Haunga Warrior isn't easy to hunt as it is strong and has high defense power as well as resistances."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "However, this should be a simple task for someone of your skill level, <selfname>.\n\nIf you do a favor for [Imperial Guard] Bekar, you will be rewarded."

On claimable
    Show quest "Good work. You've gained valuable experience from this hunt."
